    "detailed_description": "Beware the Cat Sith ! In this party game for four, Fairy folk must run away from the Cat Sith chasing them. Those mischievous creatures can\u2019t stop themselves from playing with it.<br> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129560/extras/2b9763808142ea01184f6ba3ee843ad0.poster.avif?t=1722586189\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129560/extras/2b9763808142ea01184f6ba3ee843ad0.webm?t=1722586189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>In this game of pursuit, each player is a member of the fairy folk from the celtic mythology. A fae shapeshifts into the dreadful Cat Sith, a dangerous predator to the fairy folk. They must chase their friends and touch it, morphing their victim into the Cat and take back their original form.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129560/extras/5dabf453763664967fbee223a92cf098.poster.avif?t=1722586189\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129560/extras/5dabf453763664967fbee223a92cf098.webm?t=1722586189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129560/extras/5dabf453763664967fbee223a92cf098.mp4?t=1722586189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Join the fairy folk in this children\u2019s game adaptation. Pick your color and get in this mythic chase with your friends on a single screen.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A UNION BETWEEN CHILDREN\u2019S GAME AND CELTIC MYTHOLOGY</h2>Fairy Tag is a party game for 3 to 4 players, in which players fight in a race for score. Two roles are available, Cat Sith or Fairy. The Cat Sith must catch a Fairy to exchange its role with them.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GAIN MOST POINTS</h2>Fairies must twirl around the Cat Sith to gain maximum points. The more you play with fire, the better your score will be. But don\u2019t let the Cat Sith touch you, or else it will take all your accumulated score.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CUSTOMIZATION OF GAME ROUND</h2>Players can customize their avatar in game amidst the Fae people. Length of a round is personalized, as well as the effects in game, like theft of points.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DYNAMIC PLAYGROUND</h2>Diverse areas of the game are trapped and complicate the task of the players. Beware of the remains of an old mill, and avoid getting stuck in the river\u2019s mud.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MAGICAL POWERS</h2>The Fae people are branded with multiple magical powers to unleash against the cat, or other fairies.<br><br>__________<br><br>Playable solely with joypad (for now)",
